description	"Galen Marek aka 'Starkiller'

A rushdown Saberist with both light and dark Force Powers.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber
-- Saber/Blaster Defense (1)
-- Blaster Deflect (1)
-- Shocks on hit
-- 25% more special damage
-- 25% more knockback
-- EX Saber Throw (3) ^3[CS1]
--- 66% more damage
> Single (Purple)
-- 25% less damage
> Double (Dual)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Pull (2)
- Sense (1)
- Lightning (3) ^3[CS4]
- Grip (3) ^3[CS3]
- Repulse ^3[Melee CS1]

^8Attributes:
- Healing (1)
- Force Block/Focus (3)"